Error [E0712]: this `#Caps` region uses the effect `FS, IO`, which it has no ability for
  --> tests/ui/grant_out_of_set.jet:4:22
    |
  4 |     #Caps(abilities: Net) {
    |                      ^^^^
 Why: `#Caps(…)` allows only `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: add `FS, IO` to the `#Caps(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
